hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1005","We were told by Bundar, we were told by Abu Amir, we were told by Zum’ah, H, and Nasr bin Ali was told by us, he said: Abu Ahmad told us, I am Zum’ah, on the authority of Salamah bin Wahram, on the authority of Ikrimah, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, that the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, “prayed on a carpet,” and Nasr said in his hadith: Ibn Abbas prayed On a rug, and he said: “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, prayed on a rug.” Abu Bakr said: There is a turmoil in the heart."
